{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act18d3_level_act18d3_09_end",
  "groupId": "act18d3",
  "stageId": "act18d3_09",
  "title": "笃信者",
  "storyCode": "SV-9",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_09_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6022705db4168bd16fafe7778ce057e0089a005591b3b3da5cd2d1466bb93909",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "四处都在漏水。了结它，我们得走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教？",
      "text": "为什么你们这种瞎了眼睛的庸人能苟活？为什么我这样为事业投入了生命，专注于伟大目标的人......会失败？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教？",
      "text": "盲目、停止流动的阿戈尔拴着的宠物......你们对科学和未来......毫无助益！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教？",
      "text": "我已......几近真理！为什么我要死在这里？！而你们......却能逃脱你们应得的酷刑？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教？",
      "text": "我走了这么远，我的意志和肉体，都快要撕碎人类躯壳的束缚了！为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教？",
      "text": "为什么？为什么？！为什么！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "闭嘴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教？",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教？",
      "text": "阿戈尔......必定毁灭。你们什么都不剩......什么都......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "蠢材。我活着，我就是阿戈尔，我活着，阿戈尔就活着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教？",
      "text": "......你......但......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教？",
      "text": "讽刺......讽刺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教？",
      "text": "你是不一样的。呼......你注定不同......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教？",
      "text": "你很清楚。你的命运已定。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "不要再废话连篇了。请你乖乖死掉，对你我只剩下这个请求。我很真诚的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教？",
      "text": "我诅咒你们......我要诅咒你们......直到陆地被淹没......你们会像盐粒一样，逃出大海......最后还是被大海溶解。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教？",
      "text": "在你们的尸骨堆砌的贫瘠荒原上，我们鼓动不歇的潮声会在苍白夜空下浸没大陆！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "总算死了。这事情也算是结束了......我亲手杀了它。没我想象里那样令人高兴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "比起他们对我做的这些，真是太轻了。杀了一个，还有两个。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "呃，头又有点晕了。我是怎么过来的？简直就像一直在做梦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "鲨鱼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "毕竟......没法一直醒着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "我们抓到了他们的触手，现在顺着摸过去，把他们连根拔起，一定能找到治好你的办法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "也没那么大所谓。现在它们控制不了我，我感觉很好。自由的感觉......竟然是在这时候。我快飘起来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "但是，队长，你们说的我都听到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "它是说我们也会变成海嗣？队长，你会变成特别厉害的那种？还挺强的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "不会的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你和它们可太不一样了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "希望我没有因为自己的独断专行而害了你们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "回答我几个问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "我有问必答。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我们体内流着海嗣的血？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "对。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你来这里是为了确认幽灵鲨身体问题的原因。你之所以要吃那一下是为了知道为什么海嗣想找我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你早就知道这里不止主教一只海嗣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "对。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你知道我们那场自杀一样的决战的最后，我做了什么吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "不知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我们赢了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "我也不知道。我与阿戈尔失去了联系。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......我们是不是阿戈尔的弃子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "不是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "行了。走吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "真爽快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "没什么好磨蹭的。我到底是个深海猎人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......难道二队的人不这样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "深海猎人都这样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "这里快塌了，而且......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "嘁，太多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "斯卡蒂！拿出点力气来！这里就只剩你胳膊腿都没破皮了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "还要怎样......我手都撕麻了。你上次用手伸进它们的嘴把它们撕成两半是什么时候？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "三秒前。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "刚刚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "不行。只要那具身体还在那......恐鱼就不会停。它在呼唤它们。那是个锚！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "得毁掉那具尸体才行......填埋可不够......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "我去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "text": "就凭你这破了个大洞的身子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "text": "你们可以——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "猎人们，快走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "怎么是你？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "之后再说！Mon3tr，去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
